 ture and participants need to be regular\, long distance trail runners and 
 be able to tackle elevation albeit at a walk. There will be pauses for phot
 ography and nutrition and recovery! There might even be a pit stop at the M
 HH jst before the final few kms. Bring food and water for the day and expec
